    "type": "question",
    "label": "14",
    "prompt": "A CD has diameter $11.8\\text{ cm}$, and the hole in the centre has diameter $1.4\\text{ cm}$. Find the approximate area of the CD, using $\\pi\\approx3.14$. Give your answer to 3 decimal places.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$107.765\\text{ cm}^2$",
      "worked": "Subtract the area of the central hole from the area of the outer circle.\n$$\\begin{align*}R&=11.8\\div2=5.9\\text{ cm}\\\\r&=1.4\\div2=0.7\\text{ cm}\\\\A&=\\pi R^2-\\pi r^2\\\\A&\\approx3.14\\times5.9^2-3.14\\times0.7^2\\\\A&\\approx107.7648\\text{ cm}^2\\\\A&\\approx107.765\\text{ cm}^2\\quad\\text{(3 decimal places)}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 42
